            id: "greek-heracles-hear-lycus",
            subject: "greek-heracles-amphitryon",
            at: "greek-heracles-theban-house",
            label: "Hear the account of Lycus's threat",
            text: "Amphitryon repeats Lycus's claim in the account: the boys might grow up to avenge Creon. The Theban elders answer that fear with the household's claim to shelter. These are named voices from the earlier play. Vale hears the threat and the elders' reply.",
            textTemplate: "Amphitryon repeats Lycus's claim in the account: the boys might grow up to avenge Creon. The Theban elders answer that fear with the household's claim to shelter. These are named voices from the earlier play. {actor} hears the threat and the elders' reply.",
