            at: "greek-heracles-athens-guest-room",
            label: "Deliver the plea to Theseus's table",
            text: "Vale lays Amphitryon's help tablet on Theseus's receiving table in the earlier Athenian guest room. The written plea names Megara, the three boys and their grandfather. This delivery reaches the named table; Theseus's answer follows in the account.",
