            at: "greek-heracles-theban-house",
            label: "Place clean water and a care cloth",
            text: "Vale sets the water cup and clean cloth within reach at the broken doorway. Heracles rests beside Theseus. Amphitryon sees the things placed for care. The cup and cloth remain in this earlier household.",
