            subject: "greek-danaid-melia",
            at: "greek-danaid-refuge-court",
            label: "Hear the Danaids\u2019 older plea",
            text: "Melia names the older generation in Aeschylus\u2019s Suppliant Women. Danaus brought his daughters from Egypt to the shore of Argos as they fled forced marriage to the sons of Aegyptus. The Danaid chorus asked the gods and Pelasgus for protection, holding wool-wreathed branches. Melia then turns to Nera\u2019s present request for water and shelter.",
