            label: "Hear the vote and Melia\u2019s offer of lodging",
            text: "Melia keeps the older speakers clear for Vale. Pelasgus placed the danger before the Argives. Danaus returned to report their raised hands and their resolve to protect the women from seizure, with a duty on the city\u2019s people to help. In the present court, Melia offers household rooms and common lodging. She sets out her own written pledge and a basket of bread for Nera.",
